==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/bɹiː.ðə(ɹ)/}}
* {{rhymes|iːðə(r)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something or someone that [[breathe]]s.
# A short [[break]]; a [[rest]] or [[respite]].
#: ''After a short '''breather''' she was ready to continue up the hill.''
# {{context|physics|lang=en}} A [[spatially]] [[localized]], time-periodic [[excitation]] in a one-dimensional [[lattice]].
# {{context|colloquial|dated|lang=en}} That which puts one [[out of breath]], such as [[violent]] [[exercise]].

